{"3964230": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dictapoint — Underground Pharma Simulator", "steam_appid": 3964230, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DictaPoint is an underground pharmacy-management and production sim. Build your pharma empire in a city ruled by gangs.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're a professor who refused to watch the county rot under the rule of dope and a crooked administration. Instead of the usual fix, you brought something new — a cure that can clean up the streets… or seize them for yourself.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>PRODUCE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964230/extras/9f08b987964f1f51d3856820e14c82c5.poster.avif?t=1784659848\" width=1170 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964230/extras/9f08b987964f1f51d3856820e14c82c5.webm?t=1784659848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964230/extras/9f08b987964f1f51d3856820e14c82c5.mp4?t=1784659848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own underground medicine lab by hand. Mix the components, adjust the temperature, pour it into vials and package the finished product.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SELL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964230/extras/3166952c7c1b9237f318f4c842d998a9.poster.avif?t=1784659848\" width=1170 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964230/extras/3166952c7c1b9237f318f4c842d998a9.webm?t=1784659848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964230/extras/3166952c7c1b9237f318f4c842d998a9.mp4?t=1784659848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open your own pharmacy right under the administration's nose. Fit out the sales floor, stock the shelves and watch for theft. You decide: run it all by the book, or keep part of your sales in the shadows — but be ready for the consequences.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SCALE UP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964230/extras/6eb94fcedcb515dae1b8431e4d8dc906.poster.avif?t=1784659848\" width=1170 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964230/extras/6eb94fcedcb515dae1b8431e4d8dc906.webm?t=1784659848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964230/extras/6eb94fcedcb515dae1b8431e4d8dc906.mp4?t=1784659848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The garage is only the beginning. Buy new equipment, hire staff, switch your production to automated lines. Expand your storage and move into big warehouses for serious operations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MANAGE</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964230/extras/d71a0928c766b0d2d80334549e6dd5b0.poster.avif?t=1784659848\" width=1170 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964230/extras/d71a0928c766b0d2d80334549e6dd5b0.webm?t=1784659848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964230/extras/d71a0928c766b0d2d80334549e6dd5b0.mp4?t=1784659848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set prices, track demand, redistribute resources and adapt your strategy, sort out problems with your staff — your choices shape the future. Growing too fast draws unwanted attention.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIGHT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964230/extras/136c78e88a6ed3a5c1e9fa958ed28f0b.poster.avif?t=1784659848\" width=1170 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964230/extras/136c78e88a6ed3a5c1e9fa958ed28f0b.webm?t=1784659848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964230/extras/136c78e88a6ed3a5c1e9fa958ed28f0b.mp4?t=1784659848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The administration won't sit idle while you grow. Gangs will push back, sabotage your supplies and drag you backwards, steal and cause havoc. Undermine their influence and open up new districts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLAY WITH FRIENDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-op for up to 4 players. Split the roles, cover the gaps and build your influence over the town together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Is salvation your goal? Or just a well-planned business?</i></strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DictaPoint is an underground pharmacy-management and production sim. Build your pharma empire in a city ruled by gangs.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're a professor who refused to watch the county rot under the rule of dope and a crooked administration. Instead of the usual fix, you brought something new — a cure that can clean up the streets… or seize them for yourself.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>PRODUCE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964230/extras/9f08b987964f1f51d3856820e14c82c5.poster.avif?t=1784659848\" width=1170 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964230/extras/9f08b987964f1f51d3856820e14c82c5.webm?t=1784659848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964230/extras/9f08b987964f1f51d3856820e14c82c5.mp4?t=1784659848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own underground medicine lab by hand. Mix the components, adjust the temperature, pour it into vials and package the finished product.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SELL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964230/extras/3166952c7c1b9237f318f4c842d998a9.poster.avif?t=1784659848\" width=1170 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964230/extras/3166952c7c1b9237f318f4c842d998a9.webm?t=1784659848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964230/extras/3166952c7c1b9237f318f4c842d998a9.mp4?t=1784659848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open your own pharmacy right under the administration's nose. Fit out the sales floor, stock the shelves and watch for theft. You decide: run it all by the book, or keep part of your sales in the shadows — but be ready for the consequences.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SCALE UP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964230/extras/6eb94fcedcb515dae1b8431e4d8dc906.poster.avif?t=1784659848\" width=1170 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964230/extras/6eb94fcedcb515dae1b8431e4d8dc906.webm?t=1784659848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964230/extras/6eb94fcedcb515dae1b8431e4d8dc906.mp4?t=1784659848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The garage is only the beginning. Buy new equipment, hire staff, switch your production to automated lines. Expand your storage and move into big warehouses for serious operations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MANAGE</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964230/extras/d71a0928c766b0d2d80334549e6dd5b0.poster.avif?t=1784659848\" width=1170 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964230/extras/d71a0928c766b0d2d80334549e6dd5b0.webm?t=1784659848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964230/extras/d71a0928c766b0d2d80334549e6dd5b0.mp4?t=1784659848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set prices, track demand, redistribute resources and adapt your strategy, sort out problems with your staff — your choices shape the future. Growing too fast draws unwanted attention.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIGHT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964230/extras/136c78e88a6ed3a5c1e9fa958ed28f0b.poster.avif?t=1784659848\" width=1170 height=434 ><source sr